SUMMARY:Hike in Rocky Fork State Park
DESCRIPTION:WNC Sierra Club\nJoin WNC Sierra Club for a beautiful hike in 
 Rocky Fork State Park just over the border in Tennessee. We will be hiking
  on a trail that follows a beautiful stream with cascades and small waterf
 alls that is nestled in a beautiful forest. We will do an out and back hik
 e for about 5 miles with about 900 feet of elevation gain.\n\nYOU NEED TO 
 EMAIL THE HIKE LEADER OR SEND A MEETUP MESSAGE TO GET SIGNED UP AND GET IN
 FORMATION ABOUT THE MEETING SPOT!!\nEd Maggart - edmaggart@gmail.com
